{
  "id": "ce2WF02bRenderSh",
  "name": "CEFFLO CE2 · 02b · Render Shot",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "ce2WF02bRenderSh-1",
      "name": "Note 1",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -80,
        -420
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 02b · Render one shot\n- **vo** → ElevenLabs (Kak Zee voice) → upload to render worker → `audio_url`\n- **screen** → real CEFFLO screen clip from the library (never AI-generated UI)\n- **broll** → keyframe (image model + Kak Zee references) → **Seedance** (poll ≤ 10 min) → fallback **Kling**\n- **talking** → keyframe → **OmniHuman** lip-sync with the VO audio\nPrompt style is enforced: handheld phone, natural light, no cinematic/4K.\n⚠️ Kling needs a JWT from AK/SK: set env `NODE_FUNCTION_ALLOW_BUILTIN=crypto` on n8n.\n⚠️ Image + OmniHuman request bodies are adapters — adjust to the provider you sign up with.",
        "width": 620,
        "height": 320,
        "color": 4
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "ce2WF02bRenderSh-2",
      "name": "From 02",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.executeWorkflowTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "inputSource": "passthrough"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "ce2WF02bRenderSh-3",
      "name": "Config",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        200,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "runOnceForAllItems",
        "jsCode": "// ===== CEFFLO Content Engine V2 — CONFIG (edit here; secrets live in Credentials) =====\nreturn [{ json: { config: {\n  tz: 'Asia/Kuala_Lumpur',\n  founderChatId: 'SET_TELEGRAM_CHAT_ID',          // your Telegram user/chat id (numbers)\n  dailyBudgetUsd: 25,                              // generation stops when today's cost reaches this\n  deepseek: { url: 'https://api.deepseek.com/chat/completions', model: 'deepseek-v4-flash', temperature: 0.8 },\n  image: { url: 'SET_IMAGE_API_URL', model: 'SET_IMAGE_MODEL',\n           personaRefs: ['SET_KAK_ZEE_REF_FRONT_URL', 'SET_KAK_ZEE_REF_3Q_URL', 'SET_KAK_ZEE_REF_FULL_URL'],\n           wardrobe: 'plain pastel baju kurung moden or simple blouse with tudung bawal, casual' },\n  seedance: { url: 'https://ark.ap-southeast.bytepluses.com/api/v3/contents/generations/tasks', model: 'SET_SEEDANCE_MODEL_ID' },\n  kling: { url: 'https://api-singapore.klingai.com/v1/videos/image2video', model: 'kling-v2-1' },\n  omni: { submitUrl: 'SET_OMNIHUMAN_SUBMIT_URL', pollUrl: 'SET_OMNIHUMAN_POLL_URL' },\n  eleven: { voiceId: 'SET_KAK_ZEE_VOICE_ID', model: 'eleven_v3',\n            settings: { stability: 0.4, similarity_boost: 0.75, style: 0.15, use_speaker_boost: true } },\n  render: { url: 'SET_RENDER_WORKER_URL' },        // e.g. https://render.cefflo.com (render-worker/)\n  screens: {                                       // real CEFFLO screen clips hosted by the render worker\n    vendor_orders: '/files/screens/vendor_orders.mp4', vendor_zones: '/files/screens/vendor_zones.mp4',\n    vendor_plan: '/files/screens/vendor_today.mp4', vendor_riders: '/files/screens/vendor_riders.mp4',\n    vendor_today: '/files/screens/vendor_today.mp4', driver_run: '/files/screens/driver_run.mp4',\n    driver_stops: '/files/screens/driver_stops.mp4', driver_pod: '/files/screens/driver_pod.mp4',\n    customer_tracking: '/files/screens/customer_tracking.mp4', storefront: '/files/screens/storefront.mp4' },\n  slots: { video: ['08:30', '12:30', '20:30'], text: ['10:00', '17:00'] },   // MYT publish times\n  meta: { graph: 'https://graph.facebook.com/v23.0', igUserId: 'SET_IG_USER_ID', pageId: 'SET_FB_PAGE_ID' },\n  threads: { graph: 'https://graph.threads.net/v1.0', userId: 'SET_THREADS_USER_ID' },\n  tiktok: { initUrl: 'https://open.tiktokapis.com/v2/post/publish/video/init/', privacy: 'SELF_ONLY' }, // PUBLIC_TO_EVERYONE after TikTok audit\n} } }];"
      }
    },
